```

## Example Usage
```zig
pub fn print_stats(some_number_of_bytes: usize, some_number_of_nanoseconds: usize) !void {
    std.io.getStdOut().writer().print(
        \\   some number of bytes: {}
        \\   some duration: {}
        \\
